{"id": "1836533", "name": "חקירת פונקציה רציונלית – שתי אסימפטוטות ושתי נקודות קיצון", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "ff", "params": ["x"], "body": "r*(x-c)*(x-d)/((x-a)*(x-b))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V9_TEX_FIX\">\n<div style=\"background: #f4f1f5; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 21px; color: #4b1f6f;\">חקירת פונקציה רציונלית – שתי אסימפטוטות ושתי נקודות קיצון</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">הפונקציה</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 19px; margin-top: 7px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)=\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">א. תחום ההגדרה</strong>\n<p>מצאו את שתי נקודות אי־ההגדרה בסדר עולה.</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle x_1=\\) [[input:ans1]]\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle x_2=\\) [[input:ans2]]\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ב. נקודות הקיצון</strong>\n<p>מצאו את שיעורי ה־\\(\\displaystyle x\\) של שתי נקודות הקיצון וסווגו כל אחת.</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #faf9fb; border: 1px solid #eeecef; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; text-align: center;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\) [[input:point1]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">[[input:classification1]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:point1]][[validation:classification1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #faf9fb; border: 1px solid #eeecef; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; text-align: center;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\) [[input:point2]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">[[input:classification2]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:point2]][[validation:classification2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ג. גבולות ליד האסימפטוטות</strong>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #faf9fb; border: 1px solid #eeecef; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_1^-}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; text-align: center;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_1^+}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; text-align: center;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #faf9fb; border: 1px solid #eeecef; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_2^-}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans6]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; text-align: center;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to x_2^+}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; text-align: center;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ד. התנהגות באינסוף</strong>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans8]]\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans8]]</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans7]]\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ה. בחרו את הגרף המתאים</strong>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 10px; text-align: center;\">\n<div><strong>גרף א</strong><br>{{CT:2}}</div>\n<div><strong>גרף ב</strong><br>{{CT:3}}</div>\n<div><strong>גרף ג</strong><br>{{CT:4}}</div>\n<div><strong>גרף ד</strong><br>{{CT:5}}</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;\"><strong>התשובה:</strong> [[input:ans9]]</div>\n<div class=\"stack-required-validation\">[[validation:ans9]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396485_EXTREMA_FUNCTIONSTUDY_V9_TEX_FIX\">\n<div style=\"background: #f4f1f5; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px 18px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</strong></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #d9d1dd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<p>נקודות אי־ההגדרה הן \\(\\displaystyle x_1={{CT:6}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle x_2={{CT:7}}\\).</p>\n<p>הנגזרת מתאפסת ב־\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:8}}\\) וב־\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:9}}\\). סוג כל נקודה נקבע מסימן הנגזרת השנייה. הגרף הנכון הוא גרף <strong>{{CT:10}}</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "x", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "x", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "x", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "x", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords"